        <label>Cold isolation</label>
        <description>In order to resist the cold, this person used a lot of dangerous means, sacrificing their body for short-term low-temperature resistance.\n\nThese methods can make people ignore the impact of wind and snow in a short period of time, and slightly increase a person's nervous excitement. But when the effects of drugs and alcohol fade, the returning chill and pain will completely engulf the person.\n\nNo one would do this except for the fugitives and pirates who specialize in plundering in blizzards.</description>
